@projectId = 1

### Create experience project
POST {{host}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/experience-projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "채용 플랫폼 리뉴얼",
    "summary": "이력서 작성 경험을 개선하고 지원 전환율을 높인 프로젝트",
    "period": {
        "startAt": "2025-01-01",
        "endAt": "2025-06-30"
    },
    "role": "Backend Developer"
}

### Update experience project
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/experience-projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "채용 플랫폼 리뉴얼",
    "summary": "이력서 작성 경험과 지원 전환 퍼널을 개선한 프로젝트",
    "period": {
        "startAt": "2025-01-01",
        "endAt": "2025-07-31"
    },
    "role": "Backend Engineer"
}

### Delete experience project
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/experience-projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
